#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0359 expect=skipped domain=FM
#note "THE R-4.11 HOIST PIN (top-level-or board wave 2, group J): the pre-split rule guarded each branch with an in-Check var_exists; the split hoists each guard to Requirements.Variables.All [own variable], so with no RPPLDY column this half SKIPs, naming the variable, instead of executing silently. DISCRIMINATOR: RPPLSTDY carries the non-integer '3.5' and is deliberately present - that is CDISC-SEND-0359-A's state, reported there and never here. If this EXECUTES, the hoisted gate has been removed - escalate, do not rewrite."
#library standard=sendig-dart version=1-2
dataset FM class=FINDINGS label="Fetal Measurements"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col FMSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col FMTESTCD type=Char label="Test Short Name"
col RPPLSTDY type=Num label="Repro Phase Day Timing"
---
S1 | FM | 001 | 1 | BWFET | 3.5
S1 | FM | 001 | 2 | BWFET | 12
